  "releaseNotes": "A packaging release: the library, its API and the binary format are unchanged since 8.4.0, and the package is the same as 8.4.1 (only its version differs). The release workflow now pushes the NuGet packages and their symbol packages to nuget.org by itself (trusted publishing). Since 8.4.1, the RPM package of PStudio, pedit, pcfg, ppak and ppakz is built on Rocky Linux 9 (RHEL compatible), and installed, tried and removed there before the release. The Windows installer and the Debian package are unchanged.",
